+# Data-goal audit / revision draft-v001
+
+Основание: [learning contract guide](../../docs/ml/learning-contract.md).
+
+- Goal contract revision/digest / G-IDs / explicit vs proposed requirements:
+- Dataset/selected subset/transform/template/tokenizer/masks/sampler recipe hashes:
+- Scope: research recipe / actual authorized audit; inspected vs unknown:
+- Split and final-holdout exposure policy; private evidence location:
+
+| G-ID | Expected training signal или preservation check | Actual subset/spans | Unique records/groups | Scored content tokens / EOT / input tokens / repeats | Semantic review selection/N/oracle/results | supported/insufficient/contradictory/unknown/not_applicable | Evidence/limits |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+
+## Actual targets и предъявление
+
+- Raw → selected → actual scored labels: что осталось/исключено по G-ID и почему:
+- Target lengths per supervised turn/span (без EOS/EOT), quantiles/histograms; input lengths отдельно:
+- Task/domain/language/style/time cohorts, support gaps; target-token shares отдельно от input-token shares:
+- Whole-chain order / shuffle or curriculum / seed / epoch / repeat windows / LR schedule; cohort-position confounds:
+- Чего metric proxy/automated audit не проверяет; semantic review coverage/disagreement/failures:
+
+## Verdict / readiness
+
+- Verdict: not_run (data_goal_ready / blocked / not_run).
+- Required G-ID support thresholds и их task-specific rationale: unassigned.
+- Mechanical gate status отдельно от goal alignment:
+- Contradictions / insufficient support / unknowns / proposed remedy:
+- Неизменные goal/data/recipe subject; следующие разрешённые проверки и remaining gates:
+- Benchmark G-ID mapping; candidate quality: not_run.
+
+Ни mechanical PASS, ни пустой список ошибок без фактического review не делают dataset пригодным цели. Не менять цель/holdout, чтобы получить зелёный verdict.
